1. An LED device, comprising:
    a substrate;
    a plurality of LED units disposed on the substrate, wherein each LED unit of the plurality of LED units comprises a first sidewall and a second sidewall; and
    a plurality of conductive structures disposed on the sidewalls of the plurality of LED units to connect adjacent LED units;
    wherein the first sidewall of an LED unit of the plurality of LED units comprises $n$ conductive structures, wherein $n$ is an integer greater than 1;
    wherein the second sidewall of the LED unit comprises $m$ conductive structures, wherein $m$ is an integer such that $n \neq m$; and
    wherein each conductive structure of the plurality of conductive structures comprises a plurality of asymmetrical extending parts projecting therefrom.
